{"2710740": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Lost Legions", "steam_appid": 2710740, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The Eagles Are Lost&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Roman Legions have been destroyed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of the Battle of Teutoburg Forest, you are among the few who remain, stranded in a hostile wilderness that feels familiar, yet deeply wrong. Hunted by enemy tribes and stripped of your gear, survival alone will not be enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather what you can, raise fortified camps, and rally scattered legionaries to your side. From crude tools and bare skin to iron and mail, rely on your Roman training to endure, adapt, and uncover the truth behind your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lost eagle standards must be found. More than honor demands it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with up to 3 friends as you survive and push deeper into enemy territory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/fedb25a525992e3cf7e1c8585b719502.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/fedb25a525992e3cf7e1c8585b719502.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/fedb25a525992e3cf7e1c8585b719502.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tale of Fate and Deception</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique blend of narrative-driven adventure and open-world survival crafting. Climb the ranks and journey through six distinct biomes, each advancing the story as you uncover a world that feels like an ancient Roman fairy tale, dark, mysterious, and full of hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet over 20 enigmatic characters, including Legate Publius Quinctilius Varus. Form alliances, question loyalties, and navigate a story shaped by twists, revelations, and shifting motives. In this world, few are what they seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/7aaa41953628a2a0396ed53403e308bc.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/7aaa41953628a2a0396ed53403e308bc.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/7aaa41953628a2a0396ed53403e308bc.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rally Your Fellow Legionaries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t survive alone for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the wilderness, you’ll encounter scattered survivors of the fallen legions. Free them, earn their trust, and uncover their stories through dedicated questlines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will fight alongside you in battle or offer valuable knowledge, while others find refuge in your camp. Each brings their own perspective on the world, and the fate that awaits you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/81d06c45ca1d381fa93af1ff42663d51.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/81d06c45ca1d381fa93af1ff42663d51.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/81d06c45ca1d381fa93af1ff42663d51.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is unforgiving and never under Roman control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, gather, craft, and endure. Face hostile tribes, the Cherusci, Marsi, and Chatti, each with distinct gear and combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them to claim their equipment, complete your collection, and unlock improved versions through your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt or fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/531ee3097d793be2a93df986f082ad51.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/531ee3097d793be2a93df986f082ad51.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/531ee3097d793be2a93df986f082ad51.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a World Shaped by War and Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through six distinct biomes, from quiet meadows and dense forests to treacherous swamps, towering mountains, and war-torn fields. The land bears the scars of a lost campaign, yet not everything belongs where it should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover abandoned camps, hidden landmarks, and places that defy explanation. Track wildlife, gather rare resources, and solve environmental riddles to uncover powerful artifacts and secret paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey beyond your camp is a risk, but those who explore will find the knowledge and strength needed to face what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/0cfd0884b1692049a975a0a0dc12a6eb.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/0cfd0884b1692049a975a0a0dc12a6eb.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/0cfd0884b1692049a975a0a0dc12a6eb.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fortify and Defend Your Camps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strongholds across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct Roman fortifications, set up specialized workstations, and craft increasingly advanced gear. When warbands signal their approach, prepare your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They will come for your camp - stand your ground!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/c190438542b4d3117c5c3085c01580b9.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/c190438542b4d3117c5c3085c01580b9.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/c190438542b4d3117c5c3085c01580b9.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone or in Brotherhood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 3 others in co-op multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from distinct characters including members of the civilian convoy who marched with the legions and face the unknown together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a shared, host-led campaign where progression and decisions shape the journey for the entire group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally Lost Legionaries: </strong>Free survivors, complete their quests, and bring them back to your camp. Some will fight beside you, others share vital knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Defend Roman Camps: </strong>Construct fortifications, place workstations, and craft better gear. Prepare for incoming raids and defend what you’ve built.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Distinct Enemy Tribes: </strong>Face the Cherusci, Marsi, and Chatti. Learn their tactics, claim their gear, and unlock stronger equipment through progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a World Full of Secrets: </strong>Six biomes, hidden landmarks, rare resources, environmental riddles and more reward those who explore beyond the obvious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Survival: </strong>A narrative unfolds through exploration, characters, and discoveries full of twists, shifting loyalties, and hidden truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op Survival: </strong>Play alone or with up to 3 players in a shared campaign. Choose your character and face the world together.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The Eagles Are Lost&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Roman Legions have been destroyed</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the aftermath of the Battle of Teutoburg Forest, you are among the few who remain, stranded in a hostile wilderness that feels familiar, yet deeply wrong. Hunted by enemy tribes and stripped of your gear, survival alone will not be enough.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather what you can, raise fortified camps, and rally scattered legionaries to your side. From crude tools and bare skin to iron and mail, rely on your Roman training to endure, adapt, and uncover the truth behind your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The lost eagle standards must be found. More than honor demands it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with up to 3 friends as you survive and push deeper into enemy territory. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/fedb25a525992e3cf7e1c8585b719502.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/fedb25a525992e3cf7e1c8585b719502.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/fedb25a525992e3cf7e1c8585b719502.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Tale of Fate and Deception</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a unique blend of narrative-driven adventure and open-world survival crafting. Climb the ranks and journey through six distinct biomes, each advancing the story as you uncover a world that feels like an ancient Roman fairy tale, dark, mysterious, and full of hidden truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet over 20 enigmatic characters, including Legate Publius Quinctilius Varus. Form alliances, question loyalties, and navigate a story shaped by twists, revelations, and shifting motives. In this world, few are what they seem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/7aaa41953628a2a0396ed53403e308bc.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/7aaa41953628a2a0396ed53403e308bc.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/7aaa41953628a2a0396ed53403e308bc.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rally Your Fellow Legionaries</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You won’t survive alone for long.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the wilderness, you’ll encounter scattered survivors of the fallen legions. Free them, earn their trust, and uncover their stories through dedicated questlines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some will fight alongside you in battle or offer valuable knowledge, while others find refuge in your camp. Each brings their own perspective on the world, and the fate that awaits you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/81d06c45ca1d381fa93af1ff42663d51.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/81d06c45ca1d381fa93af1ff42663d51.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/81d06c45ca1d381fa93af1ff42663d51.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight to Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The land is unforgiving and never under Roman control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunt, gather, craft, and endure. Face hostile tribes, the Cherusci, Marsi, and Chatti, each with distinct gear and combat styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them to claim their equipment, complete your collection, and unlock improved versions through your progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adapt or fall</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/531ee3097d793be2a93df986f082ad51.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/531ee3097d793be2a93df986f082ad51.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/531ee3097d793be2a93df986f082ad51.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a World Shaped by War and Mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture through six distinct biomes, from quiet meadows and dense forests to treacherous swamps, towering mountains, and war-torn fields. The land bears the scars of a lost campaign, yet not everything belongs where it should.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover abandoned camps, hidden landmarks, and places that defy explanation. Track wildlife, gather rare resources, and solve environmental riddles to uncover powerful artifacts and secret paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every journey beyond your camp is a risk, but those who explore will find the knowledge and strength needed to face what lies ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/0cfd0884b1692049a975a0a0dc12a6eb.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/0cfd0884b1692049a975a0a0dc12a6eb.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/0cfd0884b1692049a975a0a0dc12a6eb.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fortify and Defend Your Camps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build strongholds across the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct Roman fortifications, set up specialized workstations, and craft increasingly advanced gear. When warbands signal their approach, prepare your defenses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They will come for your camp - stand your ground!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/c190438542b4d3117c5c3085c01580b9.poster.avif?t=1788272864\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/c190438542b4d3117c5c3085c01580b9.webm?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2710740/extras/c190438542b4d3117c5c3085c01580b9.mp4?t=1788272864\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Alone or in Brotherhood</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo or with up to 3 others in co-op multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from distinct characters including members of the civilian convoy who marched with the legions and face the unknown together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join a shared, host-led campaign where progression and decisions shape the journey for the entire group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rally Lost Legionaries: </strong>Free survivors, complete their quests, and bring them back to your camp. Some will fight beside you, others share vital knowledge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and Defend Roman Camps: </strong>Construct fortifications, place workstations, and craft better gear. Prepare for incoming raids and defend what you’ve built.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight Distinct Enemy Tribes: </strong>Face the Cherusci, Marsi, and Chatti. Learn their tactics, claim their gear, and unlock stronger equipment through progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a World Full of Secrets: </strong>Six biomes, hidden landmarks, rare resources, environmental riddles and more reward those who explore beyond the obvious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Survival: </strong>A narrative unfolds through exploration, characters, and discoveries full of twists, shifting loyalties, and hidden truths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Co-op Survival: </strong>Play alone or with up to 3 players in a shared campaign. Choose your character and face the world together.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Survive the aftermath of the historic Battle of the Teutoburg Forest in this story-driven open-world Roman survival game, with mythological elements. Build camps, free lost legionaries to fight by your side, defend against tribal raids, and explore an ancient Germanic world alone or with friends.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, German, French, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "h